@startuml context-view
' arc42 §3 Context view – subsystem Analysis as a blackbox, neighbours as named in arc42 §3.1/§3.2
title Context View – Subsystem Analysis (Blackbox)
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

actor "Engineer" as ENG

component "React UI\n<<Frontend>>\nVite, localhost:5173" as UI #eeeeee

component "Subsystem Analysis\n<<Bounded Context Analysis>>\nCoordinator :3000 · Config Service :3001" as ANALYSIS #fff2cc

component "Manufacturing\n<<Bounded Context>>" as MANU #eeeeee
component "SAP ERP\n<<External System>>" as ERP #eeeeee
component "CRM\n<<External System>>" as CRM #eeeeee

ENG --> UI : manage configurations,\nstart analysis, retry,\nsimulate failure

UI -(0- ANALYSIS : IConfig (GET/POST /configs, GET/PUT /configs/:id)
UI -(0- ANALYSIS : IAnalysis (POST /analysis/start,\nPOST /analysis/:runId/retry/:cluster)
UI -(0- ANALYSIS : ISimulationProxy (GET /simulation/statuses,\nPOST /simulation/:cluster/up|down)
UI -(0- ANALYSIS : IStream (SSE GET /analysis/:runId/stream:\nstatus, result, overall)

ANALYSIS .. MANU : Partnership
ANALYSIS .. ERP : Anti-Corruption Layer
ANALYSIS .. CRM : Anti-Corruption Layer

legend bottom
  **Notation:** —( )— required (socket) / provided (lollipop) interface · solid = technical context (arc42 §3.2) · dotted = domain relationship (arc42 §3.1)
  **Colors:** yellow = system under consideration · grey = neighbour
endlegend
@enduml
